"Privileged unmasked serialized task. One unique hardware RNG owner; a "
"repeated live start returns BUSY. No scheduler, Platform startup or clock-"
"profile change is implicit. A post-write IO may retain owned effects; stop "
"must succeed before releasing Platform clock resources or recovery state."

