#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"PCM frames store every slot, including inactive slots, in ascending slot "
"order; slot_bits is the container width. I2S has two 16/32-bit slots; SAI has"
" 1..32 8/16/32-bit slots. PDM has 1..8 byte-interleaved lanes; each byte "
"holds eight successive bits of one lane, so frames must divide by eight. "
"active_slots selects valid lanes/slots without compacting storage. Sample "
"byte order is explicitly declared."
msgstr ""
"PCM frames store every slot, including inactive slots, in ascending slot "
"order; slot_bits is the container width. I2S has two 16/32-bit slots; SAI has"
" 1..32 8/16/32-bit slots. PDM has 1..8 byte-interleaved lanes; each byte "
"holds eight successive bits of one lane, so frames must divide by eight. "
"active_slots selects valid lanes/slots without compacting storage. Sample "
"byte order is explicitly declared."

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
