#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid ""
"Every callback is synchronous, bounded and non-reentrant. claim grants the "
"unique role owner of this exact lane and atomically rejects a reused/non-"
"increasing local boot epoch, even after ordinary join. Its authoritative "
"hardware boot owner preserves this history across CPU resets; exhaustion "
"fails closed. Rejection has no effects. unclaim follows final join only and "
"never erases boot identity history. clean/invalidate cover exact complete "
"isolated cache lines, finish their architectural barriers, and may fail. A "
"failed clean MUST NOT publish a control word. acquire/release are infallible "
"atomic 32-bit coherent control operations: the port owns any control-cache "
"maintenance. They must order descriptor/payload access across both CPUs and "
"bus fabric. stopped proves the named old peer CPU, DMA, IRQ and all observers"
" can never access the lane or payload again. The context binds the exact "
"physical lane and peer execution epoch covered by stopped. An epoch "
"observation, cancel, deadline or elapsed timeout never supplies this proof. "
"No existing single-core SoC supplies it."
msgstr ""
"Every callback is synchronous, bounded and non-reentrant. claim grants the "
"unique role owner of this exact lane and atomically rejects a reused/non-"
"increasing local boot epoch, even after ordinary join. Its authoritative "
"hardware boot owner preserves this history across CPU resets; exhaustion "
"fails closed. Rejection has no effects. unclaim follows final join only and "
"never erases boot identity history. clean/invalidate cover exact complete "
"isolated cache lines, finish their architectural barriers, and may fail. A "
"failed clean MUST NOT publish a control word. acquire/release are infallible "
"atomic 32-bit coherent control operations: the port owns any control-cache "
"maintenance. They must order descriptor/payload access across both CPUs and "
"bus fabric. stopped proves the named old peer CPU, DMA, IRQ and all observers"
" can never access the lane or payload again. The context binds the exact "
"physical lane and peer execution epoch covered by stopped. An epoch "
"observation, cancel, deadline or elapsed timeout never supplies this proof. "
"No existing single-core SoC supplies it."

