msgstr "[in] Transient full readable user header, copied once."

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "[in] Transient readable SUBMIT bytes; NULL otherwise."
msgstr "[in] Transient readable SUBMIT bytes; NULL otherwise."

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "[out] Transient disjoint full writable user reply."
msgstr "[out] Transient disjoint full writable user reply."

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after reply copy; identity/span/protocol/copy/control errors "
"otherwise. No user address survives any return. A reply-copy error can follow"
" acceptance: POLL the proposed slot/epoch; duplicate SUBMIT cannot replay or "
"replace it."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS after reply copy; identity/span/protocol/copy/control errors "
"otherwise. No user address survives any return. A reply-copy error can follow"
" acceptance: POLL the proposed slot/epoch; duplicate SUBMIT cannot replay or "
"replace it."

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "Close copied admission and cancel this binding's live work."
msgstr "Close copied admission and cancel this binding's live work."

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"Trusted privileged management, not a user gateway action. Same serialized "
"lifecycle executor as dispatch/join, except synchronous identity/copy "
"callbacks may request close. This is not a general concurrent cross-task "
"control API. Close is permanent; it does not close the underlying owner. No "
"worker or provider service runs here. Keep driving the owner and authenticate"
" POLL/CONSUME through normal dispatch. Identity/copy callbacks may request "
"close, never recursively dispatch or reconstruct. All bound storage stays "
"live."
msgstr ""
"Trusted privileged management, not a user gateway action. Same serialized "
"lifecycle executor as dispatch/join, except synchronous identity/copy "
"callbacks may request close. This is not a general concurrent cross-task "
"control API. Close is permanent; it does not close the underlying owner. No "
"worker or provider service runs here. Keep driving the owner and authenticate"
" POLL/CONSUME through normal dispatch. Identity/copy callbacks may request "
"close, never recursively dispatch or reconstruct. All bound storage stays "
"live."

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "Privileged retirement after permanently lost user mappings."
msgstr "Privileged retirement after permanently lost user mappings."

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"Same trusted serialized management as close/join; never an untrusted wire "
"action. The kernel decides when cleanup is authorized. First close/cancel and"
" separately drive the real owner. Every retained exact cell must acquire "
"SETTLED and the owner must be idle. The trusted drained proof then fences "
"future gateway entries and joins all outer observers while retaining the "
"role. Only then are all copied payloads wiped and cells retired without user "
"copyout. Pending, quarantined or unjoined work retains every cell unchanged. "
"Success is idempotent and permanently rejects dispatch. It does not release "
"the role: successful join is still required before reclaiming any bound "
"storage. No forced borrow revocation, process-liveness policy or provider "
"service is supplied."
msgstr ""
"Same trusted serialized management as close/join; never an untrusted wire "
"action. The kernel decides when cleanup is authorized. First close/cancel and"
" separately drive the real owner. Every retained exact cell must acquire "
"SETTLED and the owner must be idle. The trusted drained proof then fences "
"future gateway entries and joins all outer observers while retaining the "
"role. Only then are all copied payloads wiped and cells retired without user "
"copyout. Pending, quarantined or unjoined work retains every cell unchanged. "
"Success is idempotent and permanently rejects dispatch. It does not release "
"the role: successful join is still required before reclaiming any bound "
"storage. No forced borrow revocation, process-liveness policy or provider "
"service is supplied."

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "Join closed/consumed cells, owner and trusted gateway role."
msgstr "Join closed/consumed cells, owner and trusted gateway role."

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"Trusted serialized management. No reinitialization/reopen, hidden provider "
"stop or identity registry is created. A successful join permits a fresh "
"object with a larger claimed session; never reset or reconstruct this live "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Trusted serialized management. No reinitialization/reopen, hidden provider "
"stop or identity registry is created. A successful join permits a fresh "
"object with a larger claimed session; never reset or reconstruct this live "
"object."

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after no gateway/copy, copied cell or owner publisher remains "
